<title>NETHERLANDS: RESEARCH ALERT - BAAN RAISED TO BUY.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - BAAN RAISED TO BUY.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers said analyst Neil Herman raised the</p>
<p>rating on Baan Co NV to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- Expects company to report &quot;gangbuster&quot; fourth quarter</p>
<p>results. Says it is likely to beat his revenue estimates,</p>
<p>operating margin estimates and earnings estimates</p>
<p>&quot;significantly.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Said 1997 and 1998 earnings estimates likely to rise</p>
<p>substantially.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose one to 42-1/2.</p>
</text>
